00:21:20.780 --> 00:21:22.200
to Nicky's computer.

00:21:22.200 --> 00:21:23.710
This is a realistic capability.

00:21:24.585 --> 00:21:25.418
Agent: Where's that trace --

00:21:25.418 --> 00:21:26.570
Agent: Unknown user.

00:21:26.570 --> 00:21:28.480
Again, they're using a basic capability.

