00:21:32.296 --> 00:21:34.212
any Unix computer could do,

00:21:34.212 --> 00:21:38.360
but the CIA has that added
extra stuff they put in there

00:21:38.360 --> 00:21:39.788
that's gonna correlate it

00:21:39.788 --> 00:21:42.830
