if they have such a capability,

00:22:07.157 --> 00:22:10.550
to remotely kill the power
to a specific building.

00:22:10.550 --> 00:22:13.920
When hackers hacked the
electricity system in Kiev

00:22:13.920 --> 00:22:17.533
in the Ukraine in 2015,
and then again in 2017,

