00:22:24.580 --> 00:22:25.621
I don't know if this is something

00:22:25.621 --> 00:22:27.920
that could be realistically done

00:22:27.920 --> 00:22:31.253
in such a targeted manner,
to one house in particular.

00:22:33.550 --> 00:22:38.280
We see IP addresses that
are simply impossible.

00:22:38.280 --> 00:22:41.880
For example, an IP address
that begins with 300.

