Each octet has three digits.

00:22:49.800 --> 00:22:51.420
The digits, of course, could be zero.

00:22:51.420 --> 00:22:53.644
So it could be anything

00:22:53.644 --> 00:22:57.860
from zero to 255.

00:22:57.860 --> 00:23:00.037
Anytime in the movies
you see an IP address

00:23:00.037 --> 00:23:01.294
that starts with --

00:23:01.294 --> 00:23:04.410
you know, that's, like, 257,

00:23:04.410 --> 00:23:05.570
it's bogus.

00:23:05.570 --> 00:23:07.054
It doesn't exist in the real world.

00:23:07.054 --> 00:23:09.930
